grade with three parked1835 farm wagons and an empty1904 Prairie Avenue carriage. Covered blue/oxide and oak/darkoak wagons keep their individual seeds, wear, stands, bearings and laid-by yokes. Light/far/load-failure fallback and reconstructed provenance remain. Maker/ownership are unknown; C02 is a generic period type. Full photographic quality, compressedLODs, people/horses, traffic and boarding remain open.\n\nCurrent committed source:0a037632481037dcc903fa11697da5681b519f80. Its full1040-step/380selftest preflight, exactcommit checks and postcommit publish/mirror checks passed. Actual covered acceptance has22normal source/published desktop/mobile images,82frames within the original budgets and0page/console/request errors, with34categorized warnings retained.\n\nDraft1176 is consolidated here for one final qualification. T2981 measured FullGhost allowance is still in progress: original parentfdb and2aeb read3694/8222/8465 vs3695/8223/8466 at the same pinnedpose, +1shadow-yard only. Both exceed7800 in researchGhost views; Xray also exceeds the ordinary Fulltriangle ceiling. The proposed allowance preserves allrenderingwork and ordinary/lower-tier limits. Its firstfullgate passed1040checks and failed only the new test's missing step-isolation registration; that registration is being measured/corrected before freshfullgate and its owncommit. This pending calibration is not part of0a037.\n\nEarlier17/18manual+3normalgreen qualify only2aeb; desktop13failed and no DEVmerge is claimed. Relevant tests will run once at the final combined calibration commit. Full evidence/recovery: https://github.com/kevinrhaas/chicago-tickets/tree/main/evidence/parked-vehicles-2026-10-22 .\n\n![Western Hotel blue/oxide covered wagon](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kevinrhaas/chicago-tickets/main/evidence/parked-vehicles-2026-10-22/checkpoint-combined-vehicle-preflight/source-desktop-western-front-quarter-refined.png)\n![Wolf Point oak/darkoak covered wagon](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kevinrhaas/chicago-tickets/main/evidence/parked-vehicles-2026-10-22/checkpoint-combined-vehicle-preflight/source-desktop-wolfpoint-front-quarter-refined.png)\n\nDEV only after relevantgreen; no productionpromotion. T2980 remains open for fullacceptance.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-21T20:46:17Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T01:23:57Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"fee3577684e601321f3dc927b9db1dfcee698936","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"kevinrhaas:steward/parked-period-vehicles-20261021","ref":"steward/parked-period-vehicles-20261021","repo":{"id":1384299918,"node_id":"R_kgDOUoK9jg","name":"chicago","full_name":"kevinrhaas/chicago","owner":{"login":"kevinrhaas","id":4193586,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTM1ODY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4193586?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas","html_url":"https://github.com/kevinrhaas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":false,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"description":null,"homepage":null,"language":"Python","visibility":"public","is_template":false,"topics":[],"forks_count":0,"forks":0,"stargazers_count":0,"watchers_count":0,"watchers":0,"open